mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:DLC_OBJ_Dye_Larian+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:DLC_OBJ_Dye_Larian+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Details on FaerûnColors\" src=\"/w/images/8/80/Ico_palette.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></span></span></span> <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://faeruncolors.com/dyes/vanilla/very-rare/drake-general\">Details</a> on <i>FaerûnColors</i></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>If you are logged in to the Larian Launcher, 5 bottles are found inside the <a href=\"/wiki/Traveller%27s_Chest\" title=\"Traveller's Chest\">Traveller's Chest</a> at <a href=\"/wiki/Camp\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Camp\">Camp</a>. Requires connection through the Larian launcher for the items to appear into the chest.\n<ul><li>If playing the game through Steam, you must also connect your Larian account with your Steam account.</li></ul></li>\n<li>More can be had by starting a multiplayer game with multiple people that are logged in, or by playing with a game-save on a different device.</li></ul>\n</div>     <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"3D_Preview\"> 3D Preview </span></h2>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://faeruncolors.com/#dye=drake-general\">Full-screen 3D model preview</a> on <i>FaerûnColors</i>\n</p><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><details class=\"bg3wiki-dye-preview\"><summary><span>Embed 3D model p